1. e4 d5 2. exd5 Qxd5 3. Nc3 Qa5 4. d4 Nf6 5. Nf3 Bg4 6. Ne5? { Looks like it attacks the bishop, but the knight was the only thing blocking the bishop from the queen. } 6... Bxd1 { The bishop takes the queen. White cannot take back with the knight because it is pinned by the queen on a5. } 7. Kxd1 Qb6 8. Be3 *
